      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s wild that attempts on a duly elected president have become common enough that the first thing that came to my mind when reading this was \u201chere we go again\u201d.\n\n\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Mike Davis \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 (@mrddmia)\n\nPer law enforcement:\n\nSecret Service shoots two men outside of White House on 17th and Pennsylvania NW.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/mrddmia/status/2058315520190071012#m",
