      "timestamp": "2026-05-23T23:37:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It was never about comedy.\n\n\nDemocrats (@TheDemocrats)\n\nThank you, Stephen Colbert.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/TheDemocrats/status/2057835232515039433#m",
